 C('Ladder: draw every force',p('Uniform ladder length l at angle theta to horizontal. Wall smooth, floor rough. Weight Mg acts at its midpoint.'),m(r'N_g=Mg,\quad f=N_w'),m(r'N_w l\sin\theta=Mg(l/2)\cos\theta'),m(r'\mu_s\geq\frac12\cot\theta'),why('Take torques about the base to eliminate both ground reactions.'),trap('Equality holds only at impending slip. This ideal ladder has point contacts, not a finite block base.')),
